{"channelId":"UC3aHdfuz6oS9zc9khBNyhBA","row":["Eden Farmed Animal Sanctuary",1440,"Eden Farmed Animal Sanctuary, the first vegan sanctuary in Ireland, opened in 2008. It is home to more than two hundred courageous, unique, special beings, all of whom have been rescued from human use. You can connect with them and their lives through these videos. They are no different to the billions of animals used and killed every year by humans every year. The only difference between the animals at Eden and those who are exploited and killed by us is that the rescued animals' rights are respected and they have someone to tell their story. Go Vegan.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3aHdfuz6oS9zc9khBNyhBA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3aHdfuz6oS9zc9khBNyhBA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:17.571Z","channelId":"UC3aHdfuz6oS9zc9khBNyhBA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"a5567d14f7277b35c68cca1355f025359e59a20e1407b2aa2cc1994c0071cf23","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"72377d356dc5e3cec74068bde10d05d791721115071fe20ce16777b91283a53e"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3aHdfuz6oS9zc9khBNyhBA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1440,"raw":"1.44K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3aHdfuz6oS9zc9khBNyhBA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:17.571Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3aHdfuz6oS9zc9khBNyhBA"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","keywords":["animal rescue"],"role":"organization_self_report","excerpt":"Eden Farmed Animal Sanctuary, the first vega